cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "South African financial ombudsman determinations, 2005-2025"
abstract: >-
  A name-free index of every determination published by the National Financial Ombud Scheme (NFO)
  and the FAIS Ombud: outcome, topic on two independent axes, statutory provisions verified verbatim,
  and a canonical link to the ombud's own publication. The determinations remain the offices'
  documents; this dataset indexes and cites them.
authors:
  - given-names: Tim
    affiliation: Independent
